    "semantic_summary": "This utility module provides a set of hardcoded, immutable texture assets (white, black, normal, missing) embedded as Base64 Data URLs directly within the code. It acts as a foundational resource provider, mapping symbolic URI keys (e.g., 'builtin://white') to their raw data representations. The primary function, builtinTextureUrl, allows other engine systems to reliably fetch these default graphics without external I/O or network dependencies."
